# What `docker build` may not send to the builder. The context is the whole
# repository (the API's image needs the workspace), so everything here would
# otherwise be uploaded and could be copied into an image.

# Secrets. Every .env file, the committed test ones too: an image takes its
# configuration from the platform's environment, never from a file.
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Rebuilt inside the image, for Linux, from the lockfile and the sources.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/src/generated
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Not needed to build, and only make the context larger.
.git
**/uploads
**/coverage
**/.DS_Store
